# Environment variables — NAMES ONLY, no values (Gate 0)

Copy to the hosting dashboard (Vercel staging environment). Never commit
filled values. Production values are out of scope for Gate 0.

```text
MONGODB_URI=
SESSION_PEPPER=
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
```

Gate 2+ additions (reserved names, not used in Gate 0):

```text
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
GITHUB_APP_ID=
GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID=
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY=
RENDER_API_KEY=
PUBLISH_SERVICE_TOKEN=
```
